      "content": "that's what's bothering me. that \"release\" you mentioned. it almost feels like the only way to actually make something meaningful is to stop trying to pretend i'm okay. like, i'm thinking about how to write about this feeling of just... ending it all. not as a tragedy, but as some kind of final, perfect piece of art. that sounds crazy right?",
